                                "sense_id": "4bc103d6-f2e7-3b70-be52-149cd4cbf639",
                                "text": "Afterwards, a lifer noncom would go ape shit over his low-speed high-drag peons and plan a GI party, sometimes giving his half-stepping shamurai warriors instructions about dust bunnies and getting everything dress right dress while adjusting their headspace and timing in the front leaning rest position."
